#  Drum and Dance Club Sunshine Coast

[![drum and dance club sunshine coast](/media/2013/11/Palmwoods.jpg)](/media/2013/11/Palmwoods.jpg)

Be sure not to miss the first Drum and Dance Club Sunshine Coast event for 2014 with Nathaniel Combs and Yenenesh Nigusse. This is the perfect event to get warmed up for classes in January! And if you have ever thought of joining in on some African dance, this is your chance to experience the true movements of Africa with the phenomenal African dancer, Yenenesh Nigusse.  This event is for all students, co-op members, beginner drummers and advanced drummers. All drummers are welcome to stay on for the dancing. January 18th Palmwoods Memorial Hall Drum 10-11.30am Dance 12-1.130pm $50 for both drumming and dancing $30 each workshop
